  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecumenical Indigenous Peoples Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A multi-actor platform for social change, with Indigenous Peoples, other Christians, churches and ecumenical organisations engaged in Indigenous Peoples&apos; work. Network aiming to work for reconciliation and the human rights of indigenous peoples. Inclusion of indigenous peoples both in the ecumenical movement and UN.</narrative>
  </description>
